# steps/table-receiver.md §10 (REVIEW dcc5fd3, fable_pc's M53 and P61 b): a field of a part's root is visible
# only to the part's methods below its declaration -- the unit's rule (unit_field_write_below_refused).  bump,
# a method of the part unit_s7_part_root_below_refused_part.lm2 (harness Parts), writes k, declared below it:
# refused where it writes, in the part.  Seen whatever its place, k would take 7.
int: r 0
r: bump()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
